[en.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_INFRA_2]
New Infrastructure II

[en.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_INFRA_2_desc]
It’s as if the ponies have become obsessed with creating a network of asphalted utopia, where everypony can trot along smoothly to their next friendship lesson.\nBut let us not forget the old saying: “All roads lead to Canterlot”... where the bureaucracy reigns supreme.

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_INFRA_2]
新基建 II

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_INFRA_2_desc]
仿佛小马们已经沉迷于创造一片由柏油铺成的乌托邦网络，让每一位小马都能顺利地抵达下一堂友谊课。\n但我们不要忘记那句古老的谚语：“条条大路通坎特洛特”... 在那里，官僚主义至高无上。

